  "definition": "Terms of Voluntary Surrender",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-11-19",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Med 500) #8945, eff 7-18-07; ss by #9900, eff 4-12-11 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Med 400); ss by #10097, eff 3-9-12; ss by #13482, eff 11-19-22",
